        },
        {
          "text": "Uba abantu bakho bephuma impi ukulwa lezitha zabo loba kungaphi lapho obesa khona, bakhuleke kuwe bekhangele ngakulo umuzi owukhethileyo langasendlini engikwakhele yona, ",
          "type": "text",
