        {
          "text": "baphenduke ngengqondo zabo zonke langenhliziyo zabo zonke elizweni abathunjelwe kilo, bakhuleke bekhangele ngaselizweni labo owalinika okhokho babo, lasemzini owawukhethayo, lasendlini engikwakhele yona, ",
          "type": "text",
